      "title": "Why is VBL down 5% despite Q3 PAT jumps on double-digit volume growth?",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/markets/news/why-is-vbl-share-price-down-5-despite-q3-pat-jumps-on-double-digit-volume-growth-126103000823_1.html",
      "description": "Varun Beverages reported a 13.54 per cent on-year increase in consolidated net profit to ₹830.6 crore for Q3CY2026, driven by double-digit volume growth in India and international markets.",
